### Document Service — HTTP smoke tests
### Requires: infrastructure running, user-service running (to get JWT token)
### Set jwt_token in http-client.env.json after login

### ── Upload Document ──────────────────────────────────────────
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="contract.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample-contract.pdf
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="metadata"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caseId": "{{case_id}}",
  "category": "CONTRACT",
  "description": "Main retainer agreement"
}
--boundary--

### ── List Documents for a Case ──────────────────────────────
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/documents/case/{{case_id}}?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### ── Get Document Metadata ───────────────────────────────────
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/documents/{{document_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### ── Download Latest Version ────────────────────────────────
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/documents/{{document_id}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### ── Download Specific Version ──────────────────────────────
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/documents/{{document_id}}/versions/1/download
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### ── Delete Document ─────────────────────────────────────────
DELETE http://localhost:8083/api/v1/documents/{{document_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### ── Health Check ───────────────────────────────────────────
GET http://localhost:8083/actuator/health

